   "function": "problem",
   "scene_type": "zlx_board",
   "spoken": "On the left a petrol engine, on the right a diesel. The petrol engine ignites with a spark from the spark plug. The diesel has no spark plug: its fuel ignites by itself in the hot, compressed air. Same pistons, same valves, a different way to light the fire.",
